# Fear of the Dark III (abyssea 2): a level 99 Warrior in Abyssea - La Theine with ten Clionid Wings and 100 cruor (a
# GM, after the login). A trade of three while available: no handler. Secodiand: 161, finished on option 0: not begun;
# 161, finished on option 2: begun (any option but 0). Accepted: Secodiand 159; a trade of two: nil; of four: 160 (three
# at least), finished: confirmed, 200 cruor (CRUOR_TOTAL 200, 300), completed (10 Abyssea - La Theine fame). Completed:
# Secodiand 159; three more: 160 again, finished: 200 cruor more, completed again (the second section matches a
# completed quest).
lists AbysseaLaTheine/Secodiand/onTrigger AbysseaLaTheine/Secodiand/onTrade AbysseaLaTheine/onEventFinish/161 AbysseaLaTheine/onEventFinish/159 AbysseaLaTheine/onEventFinish/160
char zone=AbysseaLaTheine pos=-488,-2.946,759.171 job=WAR lvl=99
item ClionidWing x10
login
currency cruor 100                      # a GM
trade Secodiand ClionidWing x3          # available: no trade handler: nothing
trigger Secodiand                       # available: 161
finish option=0                         # not begun
trigger Secodiand                       # 161
finish option=2                         # begun (any option but 0)
trigger Secodiand                       # accepted: 159
finish
trade Secodiand ClionidWing x2          # two: nil
trade Secodiand ClionidWing x4          # four (three at least): 160
finish                                  # confirmed; 200 cruor (300 in all); completed: 10 fame
trigger Secodiand                       # completed: 159
finish
trade Secodiand ClionidWing x3          # completed: 160 again
finish                                  # confirmed; 200 cruor (500 in all); completed again (the reward again)
